  50 % and 22 % opacity, scaled from the 38 dp design mark into the 66 dp safe zone of
  the 108 dp launcher canvas (`docs/design/android-design-system.md`, "Brand mark").
  The brand blue is supplied by `@color/ic_launcher_background`.
-->
